     If successful, pptthhrreeaadd__ssiiggqquueeuuee() returns 0.  Otherwise, an error number
     is returned.

EERRRROORRSS
     The pptthhrreeaadd__ssiiggqquueeuuee() function will fail if:

     [EAGAIN]           No resources are available to queue the signal.  The
                        current process has already queued {SIGQUEUE_MAX} sig‐
                        nals that are still pending, or a system-wide resource
                        limit has been exceeded.

     [ESRCH]            _t_h_r_e_a_d is an invalid thread ID.

     [EINVAL]           _s_i_g is an invalid or unsupported signal number.

